k new Ixpel and cosmetic items. Enhance your firepower by equipping modules into four available slots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you build a well-balanced Ixpel with no openings or specialize one trait to its absolute limit is entirely up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Part swaps, different colours, and stickers, the joy of building your ultimate style is yours to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728420/extras/bf22768a360b4d64ebbaf66ae25e0e9d.poster.avif?t=1780581643\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728420/extras/bf22768a360b4d64ebbaf66ae25e0e9d.webm?t=1780581643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728420/extras/bf22768a360b4d64ebbaf66ae25e0e9d.mp4?t=1780581643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Challenge Your Limits in Score Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a mission is cleared, Score Attack Mode is unlocked. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can challenge individual mission to beat your personal best, with high scores recorded for each area. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your fully customized machine to rewrite the record books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728420/extras/a897adb56207f3f37cb2b60a421afb9b.poster.avif?t=1780581643\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728420/extras/a897adb56207f3f37cb2b60a421afb9b.webm?t=1780581643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka